title: "Pixelspace"
abstract: >-
  An original 5×7 pixel display typeface — single weight, 474 glyphs,
  with the full Google Fonts Latin-core set plus Unicode Box Drawing and
  Block Elements for terminal/TUI use. Licensed under the SIL Open Font
  License 1.1.
